sup('U17-H-38-04',['38.4'],'Sēo cwēn hæfde ðā sprǣce wið Salomon','Whole conversation-partner frame: queen had speech with Solomon. Wið marks the conversational counterpart, not hostility. BT1248 II8 directly attests habban sprǣce wiþ+dative; BT1249 III7 expressly attests address/conversation wiþ+accusative. The selected Salomon is accusative in the latter permitted frame; dative Salomone is a defensible variant. Do not generalize from prior against/proximity uses.', ['U17G-EX-PROMPTS','U17G-BT1248','U17G-BT1249'])
sup('U17-H-39-04',['39.4'],'Salomon wæs ðā mǣrsod ofer eallum eorðlicum cyningum','Whole rank comparison: Solomon was celebrated/exalted above all earthly kings. The original prompt explicitly requires ofer166, hence dative eallum…cyningum. This is above in rank, not a physical location or motion inference; earlier accusative rank usage does not erase the supplied dative target.', ['U17G-EX-PROMPTS','U17G-FB95'])
sup('U17-H-40-02',['40.2'],'mīn gāst blissode on Gode mīnum Hǣlende','Whole rejoice-in frame, on+dative source/object of joy. Exact FB174.3–4 se cyning blissode on his dohtor welwillendnesse independently attests blissian on+dative; here adapt its object to the exact exercise God my Saviour. Those evidence lines are outside the selected reading, not a new reading assignment.', ['U17G-EX-PROMPTS','U17G-FB174'])
sup('U17-H-40-05',['40.5'],'of cnēorisse on cnēorisse','Whole temporal range from generation to generation. Of marks starting generation, on the succeeding extent; both selected cnēorisse forms are dative singular. BT162 directly gives fram cynrene on cnēorisse; the original prompt specifically selects of…on. This bounded temporal expression is supplied; no general equation of temporal on with spatial into is taught.', ['U17G-EX-PROMPTS','U17G-BT162'])
sup('U17-H-42-02-NUMBER',['42.2'],'būton ðæt hundtēontig and fēowertig and fēower ðūsendo','Entire attested exclusion phrase for the144000 group. BT1082 s.v.þūsend I(2)(a), citing Past52/Swt409.10, supplies a direct same-song/group parallel. Normalize printed acute length marks to Cook macrons and join the line-division hyphen in hundteóntig; retain source ðūsendo. Do not label this phrase dative or derive a general būton government rule from it. Every unfamiliar shape and the number’s arrangement are visible whole-phrase support, not independent recall.', ['U17G-BT1082'])
sup('U17-H-43-10',['43.10'],'ðēah ðe ōðre męnn eten and blīðe sīen','The complete concessive clause means although other people eat and are glad. FB317 explicitly lists ðēah-ðe, though/although; the model separates its printed hyphen as a declared presentation normalization. The following ðe is a clause-linking particle within that conjunction, not a relative pronoun meaning who/which. Eten and sīen are present subjunctive third plural agreeing with other people; this reviews actual u11-concession, whose earlier description remains unchanged. The phrase is supplied and its extra particle is not an independent recall test.', ['U17G-FB317','U17G-FB105','U17G-EX-PROMPTS'])
